---
import SystemMap from './SystemMap.tsx';
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow hero-label">vivace · a local model host by strided</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Local models.<br /><span class="strided-emphasis">Tuned while<br />they run.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">vivace runs models on your own GPU, from the kernels up. strided runs inside it, reading every step and tuning the runtime live: each change tested side by side, kept when it helps, reverted when it doesn't.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#beta" class="button">Join the vivace beta <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a href="#tuning" class="text-link">See how it tunes <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">In development for Windows, macOS, and Linux.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><SystemMap client:load /></div>
</section>
<style>
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 1fr; gap: clamp(35px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: center; padding-block: 88px 84px; }
  .hero-label { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .hero-description { color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 470px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; margin-top: 27px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-top: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 23px; }
  .hero-visual { min-width: 0; padding-top: 5px; }
  @media (min-width: 1550px) { .hero { padding-block: 108px; } }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .hero { gap: 35px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(50px, 6.5vw, 70px); }
    .hero-actions { gap: 12px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-block: 54px; gap: 48px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(52px, 10vw, 78px); }
    .hero-description { max-width: 480px; }
    .hero-label { margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .hero-actions { gap: 12px 22px; }
    .hero-visual { max-width: 540px; width: 100%; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
</style>
